The implementation plan involves setting up a Flask application that listens on port 0.0.0.0:5000. It includes initializing an SQLite database (`db.sqlite3`) to store product information, creating a `/recommender` GET endpoint to fetch products based on tags, and a POST endpoint to add new products. Input validation and error handling will be incorporated to ensure robust functionality.

### Summary of Security Guidelines
